; `:open true` does not silence the counts.
;
; `:whatever` is accepted (that is what openness buys) while both counts
; still report. Openness widens the *keyword* surface; a form that declares
; `:positional <bounded-kind>` opted into its children's count, and its
; neighbouring positional rules (`not_head_member`,
; `duplicate_positional_flag`) already behave the same way.
;
; This makes `positional_missing` the one end-of-form sweep openness leaves
; alone. Every other one (required keys, the discriminant gate, exclusive
; groups, key dependencies) is about keywords, which is exactly the
; surface `:open` widens.
;
;   positional_missing  at [scratch-pipeline]
;   positional_too_many at [scratch-pipeline fragment]
;
;   cat examples/plugins/head-counts/plugin.sjon \
;       examples/plugins/head-counts/example-open.sjon | sjon validate - --no-project

(scratch-pipeline :whatever 1
  (fragment :entry fs_a)
  (fragment :entry fs_b))
